{{also|Licht}}
==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=nl|/lɪxt/}}
* {{audio|Nl-licht.ogg|audio}}
* {{homophones|lang=nl|ligt}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{term/t|odt|*līht}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*linhtaz}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|nl}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*h₁lengʷʰ-}}. Compare English ''[[light]]'', German {{term|leicht|lang=de}}, Danish {{term|let|lang=da}}.

====Adjective====
{{nl-adj}}

# [[light]], of little weight
# {{context|metonymy|lang=nl}} [[easy]], [[mild]]

=====Declension=====
{{nl-decl-adj}}

=====Antonyms=====
* [[zwaar]] (1)
* [[gewichtig]] (2)

=====Derived terms=====
* [[lichtelijk]]
* [[lichtjes]]
* [[lichtmatroos]] {{m}}
* {{l|nl|verlichten|gloss=to reduce weight}}

====Verb====
{{nl-verb-form}}

# {{nl-verb form of|p=123|n=sg|t=pres|m=ind|lichten}}
# {{nl-verb form of|m=imp|lichten}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{term/t|odt|*lioht}}. The adjective descends from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*leuhtaz}} (compare German {{term|licht|lang=de}}, English ''[[light]]''), the noun from {{term/t|gem-pro|*leuhtą}} (compare German {{term|Licht|lang=de}}, English ''[[light]]''). Both ultimately derive from the {{etyl|ine-pro|nl}} root {{term/t|ine-pro|*lewk-||light; bright; to shine}}.

====Adjective====
{{nl-adj}}

# [[light]], [[bright]]

=====Declension=====
{{nl-decl-adj}}

=====Antonyms=====
* {{l|nl|donker}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|nl|verlichten|gloss=to make brighter}}

====Noun====
{{nl-noun|n|lichten|lichtje}}

# A [[light]], illumination
# A light [[source]]
# {{context|metonymy|lang=nl}} [[inspiration]] (in ''z'n licht opsteken''); a bright [[mind]]
#* '''1992''', [[w:A. F. Th. van der Heijden|A. F. Th. van der Heijden]], ''Weerborstels'', Em. Querido's Uitgeverij, page 52:
#*: Geen groot '''licht''', die Bossche voddendief, maar ik deed het ermee.
#*:: No genius, that rag thief from Den Bosch, but I made do with it.

=====Derived terms=====
* [[belichten]] (verb)
* [[lichtbron]] {{f}}/{{m}}
* [[lichtpunt]] {{n}}
* [[lichtpunt]] {{n}}

